  "document": "Gregor Fisher\nGregor Fisher (born 22 December 1953) is a Scottish comedian and actor. He is perhaps best known for his long portrayal as protagonist and suffering Glasgow alcoholic Rab, in the popular comedy series \"Rab C. Nesbitt\", a role he has held since the show's first episode in 1988. He has also had roles in films such as \"Love Actually\", \"Lassie\" and \"Wild Target\"."
